From aa4b19e2b6f6898c42eeef5eab61064dc3dc001b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 14:02:45 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] heat_freshwater_tsubouchi.jl: compare Tsubouchi et al.'s
 monthly blocks

Adds Tsubouchi et al.'s (2018) monthly heat (Fig. 7a) and freshwater
(Fig. 9a) per gateway, read from the figures by locating the markers (the
twelve months reproduce Table 3's annual means to within 1 unit), and
compares model, GLORYS and Tsubouchi over the same 30-day blocks; the run
mean against the annual mean follows.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AbhhvkZczyeYtTrrNtPzaw
